"The Mind Writher is an alien, mentally directed whip wielded by a Meister subtype."
"Its gold chain becomes a glowing white chain that cuts, wraps, stabs and vanishes."
"Physical strength cannot overpower it."
"It lengthens, phases out, slices concrete and iron, burns, and responds to its wielder's mood."
"It moves slower under conscious control and faster, even supersonic, when reflexive."
"The first known Mind Writher belonged to an unregistered Meister who died decades ago."
"Its second known wielder is only the second Meister ever given one."
